        "original_id": "b88acebe-4627-5329-b99c-dac87a352964",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Captain Horatio Hornblower, To Kill a Mockingbird\n- People: Gregory Peck, Virginia Mayo, Robert Beatty, Terence Morgan, Gerry Mitchell, Raoul Walsh\n- Companies: Warner Bros.\n- Organizations: Royal Navy, Academy Awards\n\nFacts:\n- Captain Horatio Hornblower is a 1951 American naval swashbuckling war film in Technicolor from Warner Bros.\n- Captain Horatio Hornblower was produced by Gerry Mitchell and directed by Raoul Walsh.\n- Captain Horatio Hornblower stars Gregory Peck, Virginia Mayo, Robert Beatty, and Terence Morgan.\n- In the UK, Captain Horatio Hornblower was titled Captain Horatio Hornblower R.N., with \"R.N.\" meaning \"Royal Navy.\"\n- In 1962, Gregory Peck’s performance as Atticus Finch in To Kill a Mockingbird earned him the Academy Award for Best Actor.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
